flowchart TD
    Develop["Develop and test in the development environment"]:::current
    Develop --> Review["Review scope, behavior, and documentation"]:::current
    Review --> Deliver["Prepare an approved client release<br/>Source, handbook, status, and release notes"]:::current
    Deliver --> Backup["Back up production data<br/>and retain the previous release"]:::current
    Backup --> Build["Build images and deploy deliberately"]:::current
    Build --> Checks{"Health and acceptance checks pass?"}:::decision
    Checks -->|Yes| Record["Record the deployed version<br/>and hand over operations"]:::current
    Checks -->|No| Recover["Assess recovery with the operator<br/>Database changes may need a restore plan"]:::current
    Recover --> Checks

    classDef current fill:#eaf5ff,stroke:#176d9b,color:#16394f,stroke-width:1.5px;
    classDef planned fill:#fff5dc,stroke:#a86c12,color:#62460c,stroke-dasharray:6 4;
    classDef unavailable fill:#f1f4f6,stroke:#8397a3,color:#3f5563;
    classDef decision fill:#ffffff,stroke:#176d9b,color:#16394f;
